# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback (Phase B3).
#
# React Router 7 owns every path below `/` on the client. Without this rule a
# hard load or refresh of a deep route (/journal, /drills/aura%20D1-a,
# /auth/callback) asks Pages for a file that does not exist and gets a 404 —
# and /auth/callback is on that list, so Discord OAuth would fail on the redirect
# back, i.e. at the first thing a new visitor does.
#
# Vite copies public/ verbatim into dist/, which is what Pages serves.
/*    /index.html   200
